ida</surname><given-names>M.</given-names></name><name><surname>Nishida</surname><given-names>B.</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>CRM1 is responsible for intracellular transport mediated by the nuclear export signal</article-title><source>Nature.</source><volume>390</volume><year>1997</year><fpage>308</fpage><lpage>311 </lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">9384386</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="N0x2c13f70N0x3591dd0"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Fwu</surname><given-names>J.-K.</given-names></name><name><surname>Djuri&#x000e7;</surname><given-names>P.M.</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Unsupervised vector image segmentation by a tree structure-ICM algorithm</article-title><source>IEEE (Inst. Electr. Electron Eng.) Trans. Biomed. Eng</source><volume>15</volume><year>1996</year><fpage>871</fpage><lpage>880 </lpage></citation></ref><ref id="Galletal1981"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Gall</surname><given-names>J.G.</given-names></name><name><surname>Stephenson</surname><given-names>E.C.</given-names></name><name><surname>Erba</surname><given-names>H.P.</given-names></name><name><surname>Diaz</surname><given-names>M.O.</given-names></name><name><surname>Barsacchi-Pilone</surname><given-names>G.</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Histone genes are located at the sphere loci of newt lampbrush chromosomes</article-title><source>Chromosoma.</source><volume>84</volume><year>1981</year><fpage>159</fpage><lpage>171 </lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">7327042</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="Galletal1999"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Gall</surname><given-names>J.</given-names></name><name><surname>Bellini</surname><given-names>M.</given-names></name><name><surname>Wu</surname><given-names>Z.</given-names></name><name><surname>Murphy</surname><given-name